&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MKTQ427R39&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is hiring a Director of International Communications to build and scale our global communications strategy. As Databricks grows its footprint, this role will own how that story gets told: new market entries, in-country investments, new offices, customer wins, and local business milestones that build Databricks&#39; reputation market by market. This role will serve as a strategic communications advisor to regional and country leaders in Europe, Asia, and the Americas and will be responsible for the execution of communications programs across those regions. This is a strategic role: turning business momentum into locally resonant news that establishes Databricks as a leader in data and AI around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What This Role Unlocks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communications advisor to regional leaders – &lt;/strong&gt;advise on PR, social, internal comms strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional news at scale&lt;/strong&gt; — a dedicated strategy for translating business growth across Europe, Asia, and the Americas into press moments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Local relevance, global consistency&lt;/strong&gt; — an approach tailored to each region&#39;s media landscape while staying true to Databricks&#39; global product and corporate narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong in-market presence&lt;/strong&gt; — deep relationships with regional leadership, agencies, and field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership for regional PR teams&lt;/strong&gt; — a dedicated manager and mentor for our international communications leads while building close relationships with U.S. based comms and product leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Communications Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Databricks&#39; international communications strategy across three regions: Europe, Asia, and the Americas (13 countries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot and drive market-specific news — expansions, investments, new offices, customer milestones, and partnerships — that builds Databricks&#39; profile in each country.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the communications strategy as the business scales into new and existing regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the connective tissue between global communications strategy and on-the-ground business momentum in every region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional business leaders, ensuring strategy reflects local business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with field marketing and country managers to identify stories worth telling on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Agency/Media Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and support Databricks&#39; communications leads internationally; set clear direction and priorities while providing the autonomy to run their markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage PR agency relationships across all 13 covered markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build direct relationships with key regional media so each market has the storytelling support it needs to land Databricks&#39; news locally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in international, regional, or global communications, ideally in enterprise software, cloud, or AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record building regional press strategies and driving coverage across multiple international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people management experience, with a track record of developing communications professionals across international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing PR agencies across diverse regions and media landscapes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong relationship-building skills with senior business leaders and field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp news judgment — able to spot and shape a story from business developments like market entries, customer wins, or new offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating across time zones and cultures, balancing global consistency with local relevance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel internationally as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot;&gt;Our &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Order and Inventory Management Team&lt;/strong&gt; is looking for a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;57&quot;&gt;Support Engineer (f/m/d) - Domain Manager&lt;/strong&gt; on a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;104&quot;&gt;Permanent Contract&lt;/strong&gt; based in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;22&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;132&quot;&gt;Lille.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;23&quot;&gt;Passionate about logistics innovation, our team of 10 designs and operates the global digital solutions orchestrating Decathlon&#39;s order and stock flows. Our impact: guaranteeing the right product in the right place at the right time for our stores, warehouses, and marketplaces worldwide. Our challenges: accelerating the group&#39;s digital transformation, integrating new business models (circular economy, wholesale), and preparing the transition to SAP S/4HANA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;24&quot;&gt;YOUR FUTURE CONTRIBUTION&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;25&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Support Engineer (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will ensure the stability, efficiency, and evolution of our order and stock orchestration tools. Your core responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;26&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;26,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Run Management &amp;amp; User Commitments:&lt;/strong&gt; Organize daily ticket resolution, ensure service level agreements (stock accuracy KPIs, dispatch timing), and provide dedicated support during peak commercial periods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;26,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Incident Resolution &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform root cause analysis, enhance monitoring tools (dashboards, control towers), and automate recurring tasks leveraging tech and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;26,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Transformation Projects &amp;amp; SAP:&lt;/strong&gt; Challenge upcoming product features with the project team, drive updates on our SAP ECC module (SD/MM), and help prepare the S/4HANA migration planned for 2028.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;26,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;26,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication &amp;amp; On-Call Rotations:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain transparent communication with stakeholders during incidents or maintenance, and participate in on-call rotations for critical operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;27&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;28&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Education &amp;amp; Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineering degree (preferably in Computer Science) or equivalent experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Functional &amp;amp; Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of supply chain processes combined with proven experience on SAP modules (SD and MM).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Automation Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Passion for eliminating manual repetitive tasks, tracking data performance, and integrating AI into daily operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Team player spirit (&quot;Play Collective&quot;), clear communication, strong prioritization skills, and collaborative leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;28,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;28,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent English is mandatory (daily international scope).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;TECH STACK&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;ERP / Systems:&lt;/strong&gt; SAP ECC (SD &amp;amp; MM modules), S/4HANA roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp; Data:&lt;/strong&gt; Operational control towers, ticketing systems, and custom monitoring dashboards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;31&quot;&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,0,0&quot;&gt;Hybrid work organization (up to 2 days of remote work per week);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,2,0&quot;&gt;Equipment provided in line with your role and our sustainability commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebook);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,3,0&quot;&gt;A local project team within a global network (international career opportunities);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,4,0&quot;&gt;Continuous learning and development (technical certifications in year one, internal/external training programs);&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;32,5,0&quot;&gt;Comprehensive compensation package (employee stock ownership scheme, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO INCLUSION AND ACCESSIBILITY&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;35&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: this is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people of all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;36&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to providing an inclusive and accessible recruitment process for all candidates. If you require any reasonable adjustments during the process, you can request them via the application form; your request will remain confidential and will not affect the outcome of your hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Senior Product Designer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Team: Product, Research &amp;amp; Design&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Prolific&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prolific is not just another player in the AI space – we are the architects of the human data infrastructure that&#39;s reshaping the landscape of AI development. In a world where foundational AI technologies are increasingly commoditized, it&#39;s the quality and diversity of human-generated data that truly differentiates products and models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Role&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Prolific, our marketplace is rooted in higher learning, and that commitment runs deep. Alongside our work to accelerate the future of AI, we’re continuing to redefine how the world conducts frontier human-centred research in industry and academic contexts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities: &lt;/strong&gt;You will be embedded in a team alongside engineers, product managers, and data scientists as well as very close operational and customer-facing colleagues. You’ll build and advocate for functional, delightful, and disruptive customer journeys that pack a lot of value. You’ll work experimentally and iteratively. You’ll conduct user research independently with the help of our consulting user researchers. You’ll be the person accountable for the product’s customer experience and satisfaction in your domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Culture: &lt;/strong&gt;Building on our Prolific Principles, we expect colleagues in the Product, Research, and Design Group to demonstrate commercial acumen, reliability, grit, and diplomacy, and to always operate based on trust and empathy – you&#39;ll be a champion of these behaviours yourself, and in the culture of your team. Accountability and autonomy are two sides of the same coin, and we expect you to demonstrate both. We care deeply about building an inclusive and diverse team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Designing meaningful products:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and solve a wide range of problems through thoughtful discovery, definition and design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think strategically:&lt;/strong&gt; Look beyond the immediate task to connect the dots, shaping the product at a high level, spotting missing pieces across the experience and ensuring design decisions align with the bigger picture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shaping outcomes that matter:&lt;/strong&gt; Help define, monitor and improve product experience experience for Prolific users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevating design at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to our design system and evolve our design processes to enable designing faster, more consistent and enjoyable experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving a culture of experimentation:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore and outline a range of solutions to solve a customer and business problem. Champion data informed design and rapid prototyping, iterating quickly to deliver value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;How you’ll do it&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Understand people deeply&lt;/strong&gt;: Build a deep understanding of the motivations and behaviours of data collectors, account administrators, integrating developers, and participants, through workshops, research and feedback loops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design journeys with impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Create flows, user journeys and mental models that help our users to achieve their goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring ideas to life&lt;/strong&gt;: Produce service maps, wireframes and prototypes that inspire clarity and collaboration.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validate and refine&lt;/strong&gt;: Test and evaluate prototypes and experiments for usability, value and feasibility to ensure we solve the right problems the right way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across disciplines&lt;/strong&gt;: Work closely with the product and engineering team to co-create design solutions and roll-out strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inspire and influence&lt;/strong&gt;: Tell the story of your design decisions with clarity and confidence, articulating the reasoning behind them across the whole Prolific team, helping elevate the role of design throughout Prolific and inspire others with your vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re comfortable with asynchronous and synchronous working that is fast-paced and constantly changing. You are a deep systems thinker who is curious about people&#39;s behaviour and passionate about how great design can improve user productivity and enjoyment. You understand product design principles and have long practical experience using them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design tools, such as Figma.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with information architecture and mapping complex systems and business processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of interface design, and a deep understanding of good visual and interactive design in dynamic contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with product analytics and A/B or multivariate testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in fast-paced environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Even better if you have&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of B2B and Enterprise customer needs and how to delight them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the AI tooling landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of developer experience, APIs, and common developer tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success in a scale-up environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inclusive design and accessibility (we’re at AA standard).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Why Prolific is a great place to work&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;ve built a unique platform that connects researchers and companies with a global pool of participants, enabling the collection of high-quality, ethically sourced human behavioral data and feedback. This data is the cornerstone of developing more accurate, nuanced, and aligned AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the next leap in AI capabilities won&#39;t come solely from scaling existing models, but from integrating diverse human perspectives and behaviors into AI development. By providing this crucial human data infrastructure, Prolific is positioning itself at the forefront of the next wave of AI innovation – one that reflects the breath and the best of humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working for us will place you at the forefront of AI innovation, providing access to our unique human data platform and opportunities for groundbreaking research. Join us to enjoy a competitive salary, benefits, and remote working within our impactful, mission-driven culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
